  "releaseNotes": "v2.6.0 - H.264 rate control: constant QP and quality besides constant bitrate (H264EncoderOptions); YUV to RGB conversions now BT.601 limited range (they decoded video-range YUV as full range: washed-out colours); BGRA / RGB24 / I420 to NV12. SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.10, SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.36. v2.5.0 - H.264 decoding: IVideoDecoder + the Media Foundation H.264 decoder (NV12 out) on desktop. SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.7, SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.15. v2.4.0 - SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.0 + SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.0. The browser test app runs on SpawnJS (SpawnDev.UnitTesting.Browser) instead of SpawnDev.BlazorJS.",
